==Albanian==

===Alternative forms===
* [[dirsë]] (Gheg)

===Etymology===
Possibly from {{etyl|sqj-pro|sq}} {{m|sqj-pro|*ən-tersā}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sq}} {{m|ine-pro|*ters-||dry}}, identical with {{term|djerr|lang=sq}} 'barren land', cognate to Ancient Greek {{term|τέρσομαι|tr=tersomai|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}, Sanskrit {{term|तृष्यति|sc=Deva|tr=tṛṣyati|lang=sa}}, Old English {{term|þurst|lang=ang}} and Latin {{term|terra|lang=la}}. Alternatively from {{etyl|sqj-pro|sq}} {{m|sqj-pro|*widertjā}}, from {{m|sqj-pro|*swidertjā}}, from pre-Albanian {{m|ine-pro|*swidrotyeh₂}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sq}} {{m|ine-pro|*sweyd-}} (compare Greek {{term|ιδρός|tr=idrós|lang=el}}, English {{term|sweat|lang=en}}, Italian {{term|sudore|lang=it}})<ref>{{R:sq:Orel|page=69}}</ref>.

